# Already tracked in HEAD and read as P1 by the context-frontloader skill, but
# `.agent/*` shadowed it, so every edit needed `git add -f`. Allowlisted so the
# rule matches what is actually versioned.
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so the
# directory is un-ignored for traversal and its contents re-ignored immediately.
# Without the middle line, allowlisting the directory would expose every other
# runtime file in it (boot prompts, recovery axioms) to the next `git add -A`.
!.agent/context/
.agent/context/*
!.agent/context/resource-map.md
!.agent/skills/skill-management/
!.agent/skills/skill-management/**
!.agent/fleet/
!.agent/fleet/agent-pathway-matrix.json
